        "text": "Adam Philip Andretti (born March 24, 1979) is an American professional racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series, driving the No. 5 Toyota Tundra TRD Pro for Tricon Garage.\n\nAndretti has raced in sports cars, Indy Pro Series, NASCAR, and Stadium Super Trucks. He has been competing in the Trans-Am Series since 2014.",
